@startuml
title Reservation State Diagram

state "PENDING" as Pending
state "RESERVED" as Reserved

[*] --> Pending : Create reservation

Pending --> Reserved : Payment successful\nconfirm()

Pending --> [*] : Reservation cancelled
Pending --> [*] : Hold expires after 5 minutes

Reserved --> [*] : Reservation cancelled

Reserved --> Reserved : confirm() called again\nNo state change

note right of Pending
ReservationStatus.PENDING

Seats are temporarily held.
Payment is PENDING.

The reservation expires
after 5 minutes if unpaid.
end note

note right of Reserved
ReservationStatus.RESERVED

Payment is COMPLETED.
Seats are reserved.
end note
@enduml
